MODIFICATIONS BY AXIOMATIC AI

Axiomatic AI has changed the forked material in the ways set out below, and
in no others.

1. MultilinearMap and PiTensorProduct were generalized to be semilinear in each
   argument -- `MultilinearMap R` becomes `MultilinearMap σ` for a `RingHom σ`
   -- so that a multilinear map may be conjugate-linear in each argument. No
   declaration was removed and no file was added. The 24 changed files, all
   under Mathlib/, are:

     Mathlib/Analysis/Calculus/ContDiff/FaaDiBruno.lean
     Mathlib/Analysis/Normed/Module/Multilinear/Basic.lean
     Mathlib/Analysis/Normed/Module/Multilinear/Curry.lean
     Mathlib/Analysis/Normed/Module/PiTensorProduct/InjectiveSeminorm.lean
     Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/Alternating/Basic.lean
     Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/Alternating/DomCoprod.lean
     Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/Multilinear/Basic.lean
     Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/Multilinear/Basis.lean
     Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/Multilinear/Curry.lean
     Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/Multilinear/DFinsupp.lean
     Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/Multilinear/DirectSum.lean
     Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/Multilinear/FiniteDimensional.lean
     Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/Multilinear/Finsupp.lean
     Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/Multilinear/Pi.lean
     Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/Multilinear/TensorProduct.lean
     Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/PiTensorProduct.lean
     Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/PiTensorProduct/DFinsupp.lean
     Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/TensorAlgebra/Basic.lean
     Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/TensorAlgebra/ToTensorPower.lean
     Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/TensorPower/Basic.lean
     Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/TensorPower/Pairing.lean
     Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/TensorPower/Symmetric.lean
     Mathlib/RingTheory/PiTensorProduct.lean
     Mathlib/Topology/Algebra/Module/Multilinear/Basic.lean

2. Mathlib's own development tooling, CI configuration and documentation
   generation were removed -- PR labelling, deprecation rewriting, downstream
   dashboards, benchmarking harnesses and the workflows that ran them.

3. Five further files were edited so that the fork builds and caches this
   benchmark. No other file outside Mathlib/ has been changed.

     lakefile.lean        declares the AxQM library and the `grade`
                          executable; drops mathlib's Archive and
                          Counterexamples targets; disables one text linter,
                          which would have required renaming files away from
                          the book's item numbers
     Cache/Hashing.lean   adds AxQM.lean as a hashing root beside Mathlib.lean
     Cache/IO.lean        caches the AxQM library's oleans beside mathlib's
     scripts/README.md    rewritten to document the scripts that remain
     .gitignore           project-local entries

   Mathlib.lean, lake-manifest.json and lean-toolchain are unchanged.


